+### Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=estevanmaito%2Fwindmill-dashboard)
+
+Wasmer serves the `public` folder as a static site: the `Staticfile` selects static hosting and no build step runs, so the committed `tailwind.output.css` is used. The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the detected build settings and click Deploy; it does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account. To customize the dashboard, fork the repository, rebuild the CSS with `npm run build` if you change the Tailwind sources, and import your fork.
+
 ## 🦮 Accessibility
 
 This dashboard was developed with a11y in mind since the beginning.
